    {"issue": "\"The next salary adjustment is scheduled for April 1, 2015\" is ambiguous as to whether it promises an increase on that date or merely a review, given the preceding sentence making adjustment discretionary with the Board. \"Annual review for adjustment\" sets no benchmark or direction for the adjustment.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.28}
