  {"clause_id": "c006", "issues": [
    {"issue": "The Executive is given a \"right to receive an annual bonus in the amount of $140,000\" yet the same sentence conditions it on satisfying KPIs \"established by the Corporation in accordance with its standard KPI system,\" a standard nowhere fixed in the Agreement. It is ambiguous whether the bonus is a fixed entitlement or wholly discretionary, and whether the $140,000 is annual or per semi-annual payment.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.52},
    {"issue": "The condition that Executive \"remains an employee of the Corporation in good standing on the date of payment\" must be read against Section 5(b), which cuts off all rights to bonuses that would become payable after termination. Whether a bonus earned for a completed half-year survives termination before the payment date is unresolved between the two provisions.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.34}
  ]},
  {"clause_id": "c007", "issues": [
    {"issue": "The matching contribution commences \"at such time when the Company is able to make such matching contribution under the Plan,\" a condition of indefinite duration resting entirely on the Corporation's own ability, and \"the Company\" is not a defined party in this Agreement (the party is \"the Corporation\"). Neither the trigger nor the actor is fixed.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.26}
  ]},
  {"clause_id": "c008", "issues": [
